{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":62565,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793468608378,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2015,"episodeCount":24,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gqQ1C3RxIZ3hgjiG97KSNDAGHwn.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1057795","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"La mia storia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo Gouda is a first-year high school student. Clocking in at 2 meters and 120 kilos, Takeo is a socially awkward hothead who's straight as an arrow. One day, he saves a high school girl from a groper on a train, and falls in love with her the next day when she comes by to thank him. But he believes that she must have fallen instead for his best friend with model-like good looks.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-04-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iJ8j4U5R2GKFtT1bwGJJxxjzoRJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iJ8j4U5R2GKFtT1bwGJJxxjzoRJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1060457","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Il mio amore","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo and Rinko are now text pals. Takeo's heart skips a beat every time he gets a girly text from Rinko, but he believes Rinko has fallen for Suna and vows to make her dream come true.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/erBajQasnxP5AWPEmUfjPjHTiqj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/erBajQasnxP5AWPEmUfjPjHTiqj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1060458","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Il mio demone blu","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo and Rinko finally meet alone. Although Takeo had thought that Rinko just wanted some relationship advice for approaching Makoto, Takeo is taken aback when Rinko starts crying.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kfmxRjVNvOVFh4L8iwtwly98sfR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kfmxRjVNvOVFh4L8iwtwly98sfR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1060459","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Il mio fidanzato","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rinko's crush wasn't Makoto, but Takeo! Elated by having a girlfriend for the very first time, Takeo's heart is about to burst from happiness. But Takeo's true mettle is about to be tested when a major accident occurs during a singles meetup between his and Rinko's friends...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rThsiGSS3ZzMedEyzJhOWjjxBPw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rThsiGSS3ZzMedEyzJhOWjjxBPw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1060460","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Sono un testone","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Makoto's older sister Ai is shocked to learn that Takeo is dating. Having secretly harbored feelings of her own for Takeo, Ai is suspicious of Takeo's girlfriend and launches her own investigation...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1eGWVBEBUo9LAPfrDCXTGeB6HC1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1eGWVBEBUo9LAPfrDCXTGeB6HC1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1077624","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Il mio desiderio","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Now that he has a girlfriend for the first time in his life, Takeo has been treating Rinko with kid gloves. But Rinko's been acting unhappy of late, which leads Ai to believe that she's hiding something from Takeo. What is Rinko's secret, and what will Ai do once she finds out what it is...?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xrx2jrojJY2Z7XqkQOfLj51HiwB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xrx2jrojJY2Z7XqkQOfLj51HiwB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1077625","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"La mia forza","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo's asked by senpais in a Judo club to join them and participate in a match against their rivals, the Bianka High School Judo Club, a month later. Takeo agrees right away, and trains furiously as Rinko cheers him on. Will he win?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2gbDvi5hnRq1cdKfWI9rs7FRh4Y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2gbDvi5hnRq1cdKfWI9rs7FRh4Y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1077626","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Il mio amico","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rinko's birthday is fast approaching, and Takeo plans out their birthday date with Suna's help. Sensing something amiss with Suna, Rinko suggests inviting Suna to their date, but Suna says that he has something he needs to do that day...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gUcae5ATypjzfRo97YJYldY0udc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gUcae5ATypjzfRo97YJYldY0udc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1077627","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Io e il mio amico","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rinko's birthday is the same day Suna's father is scheduled to undergo surgery. Takeo tries to honor Suna's wishes by following through with his and Yamato's birthday date, but Takeo can't stop thinking about Suna's plight. After much thought, Takeo decides to tell Rinko.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wSO5HPqqpTgyeV2dG8rOEIWxfrS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wSO5HPqqpTgyeV2dG8rOEIWxfrS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1077628","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"La mia montagna","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo and Rinko head off to a mountain to have a picnic, but they lose their way. Takeo decides that his mission is to get Rinko home safe and sound, but Yamato's only thought is about how they have to spend the night together. Will they be able to return alive? less","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-06-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7wVEZKsINK06OwZEXbZsd9nL91W.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7wVEZKsINK06OwZEXbZsd9nL91W.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"1104055","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Il mio mare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Summer means going to the beach! Takeo and Rinko's crew get together for a beach outing. Always dazzled by Takeo's superhuman abilities, Rinko's plan is to set Takeo's heart a-flutter with her swimsuit, but will it result in anything more?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-06-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rMpKH3p6aqhCc8fussrj3X3AfZz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rMpKH3p6aqhCc8fussrj3X3AfZz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"1104056","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"La mia media voti","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Rinko makes an offhand comment that she'd like the two of them to go to the same university, it motivates Takeo to study like his life depends on it. But Rinko's first choice school is Murasakifuji, a top university. Takeo crams in preparation for a benchmark exam to figure out his chances for getting in, but will he make the cut?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Vq1qe5oSLSa0ZurQddcUCBtoYK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Vq1qe5oSLSa0ZurQddcUCBtoYK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"1104057","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Oggi offro io","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ore 13: One day, Okada meets pretty boy Oda. He'd been rejected by Suna's sister Ai, and he wanted to have a word with Takeo, who was the cause of his rejection.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dWRR9GoDTVQbtKcld6aY3ZHjzZA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dWRR9GoDTVQbtKcld6aY3ZHjzZA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"1104058","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"La mia maledizione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo and Rinko end up going to MM Land with Ai, Oda, and Suna. While the two enjoy the various attractions of MM Land, Oda tries everything in his power to have Takeo and Ai have a moment alone together in the hopes that Ai can confess her longtime feelings to Takeo. Will Ai do it?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zfcfCeEiGNumNbH127brCE0ZDGT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zfcfCeEiGNumNbH127brCE0ZDGT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"1104059","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"La mia fidanzata","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mariya Saijou, a classmate of Takeo's, would not count running as one of her favorite activities, but she ends up being assigned to a relay at the school festival along with Takeo. He tries to help her improve through practice. Mariya, who barely knows Takeo, gradually comes to realize his rare qualities...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/54ovY80ImhdhG3pbCFQFQIQlg1J.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/54ovY80ImhdhG3pbCFQFQIQlg1J.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"1104060","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"La mia discepola","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mariya Saijou tells Takeo that she likes him \"as a person\" after falling for Takeo, knowing full well that he already has a girlfriend. Being dense, Takeo takes her words literally, but what will he do once he finds out how she really feels?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pbB63CZr1cOT5hKQt7dfie0UI3t.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pbB63CZr1cOT5hKQt7dfie0UI3t.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"1104061","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Il mio Natale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo and Rinko's friends get together for a Christmas party. Takeo's friend, Osamu Kurihara, reveals that he intends to ask Nanako out, but his numerous faux pas turn Nanako off. As the party draws to an awkward close, no one knows what will happen...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o6FYzAjjLCP6DKf0T7wWqmbX3gA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o6FYzAjjLCP6DKf0T7wWqmbX3gA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"1104062","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Il mio compleanno","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo's long-awaited birthday has finally arrived. Rinko really wants to make it a memorable one by attempting a first kiss. But Takeo's obliviousness may ruin everything...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-08-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9TGEjhk6gWHvThe9ZGYeMUlYw9I.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9TGEjhk6gWHvThe9ZGYeMUlYw9I.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"1104063","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"La mia mamma","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo's mother's due date is approaching, but she continues to engage in household chores with dangerous enthusiasm. She ridicules Takeo for being anxious for her well-being, but an unexpected incident causes her to evaluate her son.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-08-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zRE1WgpMnRah0PVtKoAxLuuXsFl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zRE1WgpMnRah0PVtKoAxLuuXsFl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"1104064","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"La mia cioccolata","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeo is over the moon over his new little sister, Maki. With Valentine's Day approaching, Takeo's heart is set aflutter again since he has never gotten chocolates from a girl who liked him in his life. He can't wait to see what Rinko will give him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-08-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tDQsGSaTx1YDoL5HStwm5CTI1vM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tDQsGSaTx1YDoL5HStwm5CTI1vM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"1104065","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Io e la lettera","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Every year, Suna has received an anonymous letter and chocolate on Valentine's Day. Every time, the letter says, \"I don't need anything in return, but please like me.\" One day, Takeo senses a strange presence behind them, and meets the sender of the letter, Yukika Amami. After hearing about her longtime feelings for Suna, Takeo decides to help her!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-08-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oD6xl7kw6p4fgJ7gwsCZ5h5ENeq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oD6xl7kw6p4fgJ7gwsCZ5h5ENeq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"1103782","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Una lettera per me","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With help from Takeo and Rinko, Yukika finally manages to tell Sunakawa her feelings. Yukika takes it even a step further by inviting Suna to go on a date with her to a zoo! Yet despite having had a great time there, Yukika looks unhappy...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-09-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rPIdMfkM9zGWNWyU50nzAXYH4bp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rPIdMfkM9zGWNWyU50nzAXYH4bp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"1104073","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Le mie vacanze primaverili","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mesmerized by the cakes of Ichinose, the handsome patissier, Rinko is having a blast at her summer part-time job.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-09-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AfcqjbtFsjV9cJZkfp1Z55sn1Z0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AfcqjbtFsjV9cJZkfp1Z55sn1Z0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62565/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"1106418","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Il mio cuore","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"True love.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-09-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"ht